                                "sense_id": "cc1d30d8-c51c-3832-b0b8-37730bd853eb",
                                "text": "Here indeed, perhaps, by rule of antagonisms, may be the place to mention that, after King Richard’s return, there was a liberty of tourneying given to the fighting men of England […]"
